{"authoredAt":"2026-08-24T18:29:35.776Z","conclusion":"findings","findings":[{"category":"missing","desc":"CHK-006:happy:0 and CHK-006:adversarial:3 lack a fail-closed test and implementation contract requiring authentic read evidence on every managed proposal. packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts:1017-1036 permits candidateSpecSetDigest, corpusDigest, and readLog to be absent; packages/main/src/handlers/managed-review-evidence.ts:201-204 skips candidate binding in shadow mode when the digest is absent; and packages/main/src/tasks/managed-review-evidence-smoke.ts:1012-1057 accepts a pass envelope with no readLog. A provider can therefore obtain formal gate-consumed evidence with empty manifest arrays, no read log, and no candidate/corpus binding despite the managed prompt requiring truthful readManifest/readLog.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/host-run.ts","packages/main/src/core/managed-review-evidence.ts","packages/main/src/handlers/managed-review-evidence.ts","packages/main/src/tasks/managed-review-evidence-smoke.ts"],"severity":"high"},{"category":"adversarial","desc":"The implementation exceeds the signed B-137a scope and changes unrelated native/DONE authority. The scope permits neither creation of packages/main/src/core/delivery-review-authority.ts, packages/main/src/core/native-review-attestation.ts, or packages/main/src/core/native-review-evidence.ts nor modification of packages/main/src/handlers/delivery-check.ts and packages/main/src/core/delivery-check-hash.ts. Nevertheless packages/main/src/handlers/delivery-check.ts:210 consumes the new native capability before persistence, materially changing delivery_check_set authority for other stories. Split this authority work into a separately scoped story or explicitly expand and re-review the signed scope.","evidenceState":"verified","files":["packages/main/src/core/delivery-check-hash.ts","packages/main/src/core/delivery-review-authority.ts","packages/main/src/core/native-review-att